        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion is oriented in a parallel manner, which is often indicative of benign lesions.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c4",
        "uuid": "1db997e5-08ca-4a02-8500-7a5793feae70",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "There is no evidence of posterior shadowing, which rules out the presence of a complex cystic and solid breast mass.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c5",
        "uuid": "28c8bef0-0e02-4b8f-bca0-fea0253b5e8c",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion's irregular margins are a significant feature suggesting malignancy, contradicting expert_a's claim c1",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c6",
        "uuid": "2f89e7c3-87ec-4e6f-a2fb-f3b708493621",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The heterogeneous echo pattern of the lesion points towards a malignant finding, contrary to expert_a's assertion in c2",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c7",
        "uuid": "f5ab6dc1-2216-440b-905b-0dc01562075f",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The non-parallel orientation of the lesion in the image is indicative of a more complex mass, which can be associated with malignancy, disagreeing with expert_a's claim c3",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c8",
        "uuid": "a5bf9784-11bb-4c6c-b591-b340d8f57bea",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lack of posterior shadowing does not exclude the possibility of a complex cystic and solid breast mass; thus, it cannot be used as a definitive indicator of benignity, addressing expert_a's claim c4",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c9",
        "uuid": "cd99ce89-716b-47ed-9859-363f00ab9cc3",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The heterogeneous echo pattern is a significant feature indicating malignancy, as heterogeneous patterns are commonly associated with malignant masses",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c10",
        "uuid": "70654056-e4a3-4fcc-bae9-3c72e9f4483c",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The non-parallel orientation of the lesion further supports a malignant interpretation, as non-parallel orientations are often indicative of complex masses, which are more likely to be malignant",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c11",
        "uuid": "21969679-2816-4207-92d5-d507a71e5132",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lack of posterior shadowing does not preclude the possibility of a complex cystic and solid breast mass. The absence of shadowing alone is insufficient to rule out malignancy, and other features such as irregular margins and heterogeneous echo patterns are more indicative of malignancy",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c12",
        "uuid": "5f16982d-a3dc-42fb-8827-8b1f68db6fbb",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion is oval, which is a characteristic of benign lesions",
